{
  "default": "claude",
  "agents": [
    {
      "id": "claude",
      "enabled": true,
      "label": "Claude",
      "command": "claude",
      "note": "Con internet se agregan WebSearch y WebFetch a --tools. Bash, Write y Edit no se agregan.",
      "internetOn": { "extendFlag": "--tools", "extend": "WebSearch,WebFetch" },
      "args": [
        "-p",
        "--input-format",
        "stream-json",
        "--output-format",
        "stream-json",
        "--include-partial-messages",
        "--verbose",
        "--setting-sources",
        "project",
        "--strict-mcp-config",
        "--no-session-persistence",
        "--tools",
        "Read,Glob,Grep,Skill"
      ],
      "promptVia": "stdin",
      "promptFormat": "claude-message",
      "parser": "claude-stream",
      "images": "claude",
      "modelArg": "--model",
      "rules": "file-arg",
      "rulesArg": "--append-system-prompt-file",
      "context": "none",
      "env": {
        "CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR": "{claudeConfigDir}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "codex",
      "enabled": true,
      "label": "Codex",
      "command": "codex",
      "note": "Con internet: codex --search exec, búsqueda en vivo, sandbox read-only (no escribe ni corre comandos con red). Sin internet: -c web_search=disabled. --search va antes de exec; codex exec --search es un error.",
      "args": [
        "exec",
        "-",
        "--json",
        "--skip-git-repo-check",
        "--ephemeral",
        "-s",
        "read-only"
      ],
      "internetOn": { "prepend": ["--search"] },
      "internetOff": { "append": ["-c", "web_search=\"disabled\""] },
      "promptVia": "stdin",
      "promptFormat": "text",
      "parser": "codex-jsonl",
      "images": "files",
      "imageArg": "-i",
      "modelArg": "--model",
      "rules": "prepend",
      "context": "prepend"
    },
    {
      "id": "gemini",
      "enabled": true,
      "label": "Gemini",
      "command": "gemini",
      "note": "Headless ya niega shell, write_file y replace. Con internet se permiten google_web_search y web_fetch (--allowed-tools). Sin internet se suman al --exclude-tools. No usa --yolo ni --approval-mode plan: plan, al salir, pasa a yolo.",
      "args": [
        "--output-format",
        "stream-json",
        "--skip-trust",
        "--exclude-tools",
        "run_shell_command,write_file,replace"
      ],
      "internetOn": { "append": ["--allowed-tools", "google_web_search,web_fetch"] },
      "internetOff": { "extendFlag": "--exclude-tools", "extend": "google_web_search,web_fetch" },
      "promptVia": "stdin",
      "promptFormat": "text",
      "parser": "gemini-stream",
      "images": "none",
      "modelArg": "--model",
      "rules": "prepend",
      "context": "prepend"
    },
    {
      "id": "grok",
      "enabled": true,
      "label": "Grok",
      "command": "grok",
      "note": "No lee stdin: --prompt-file. --yolo se sacó: aprueba cualquier herramienta, shell incluido. Quedan --tools de solo lectura, --disallowed-tools de shell/edición y --deny Bash, Edit, Write y MCPTool. --always-approve evita que se cuelgue pidiendo permiso por lo que sí está permitido; los deny ganan igual. Con internet se suman web_search y web_fetch al allowlist. Sin imágenes.",
      "args": [
        "--no-auto-update",
        "--verbatim",
        "--output-format",
        "streaming-json",
        "--tools",
        "read_file,grep,list_dir",
        "--disallowed-tools",
        "run_terminal_cmd,run_terminal_command,search_replace,write,write_file,Agent",
        "--deny",
        "Bash",
        "--deny",
        "Edit",
        "--deny",
        "Write",
        "--deny",
        "MCPTool",
        "--always-approve"
      ],
      "internetOn": { "extendFlag": "--tools", "extend": "web_search,web_fetch" },
      "internetOff": { "extendFlag": "--disallowed-tools", "extend": "web_search,web_fetch" },
      "promptVia": "file",
      "promptArg": "--prompt-file",
      "parser": "grok-stream",
      "images": "none",
      "modelArg": "--model",
      "rules": "prepend",
      "context": "prepend"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermes",
      "enabled": true,
      "label": "Hermes",
      "command": "hermes",
      "note": "Headless: hermes chat --oneshot --query-file --format stream-json. --yolo se sacó: el texto de ayuda dice que aprueba comandos peligrosos, y el toolset por defecto incluye terminal y write_file. --toolsets reemplaza ese conjunto. Con internet queda solo web (web_search y web_extract). Sin internet queda todo, que no toca archivos, shell ni la web. --image acepta una sola imagen.",
      "args": [
        "chat",
        "--oneshot",
        "--format",
        "stream-json",
        "--source",
        "tool",
        "--toolsets",
        "todo"
      ],
      "internetOn": { "setFlag": "--toolsets", "set": "web" },
      "internetOff": { "setFlag": "--toolsets", "set": "todo" },
      "promptVia": "file",
      "promptArg": "--query-file",
      "parser": "hermes-stream",
      "images": "files",
      "imageArg": "--image",
      "maxImages": 1,
      "modelArg": "--model",
      "rules": "prepend",
      "context": "prepend"
    },
    {
      "id": "aider",
      "enabled": true,
      "label": "Aider",
      "command": "aider",
      "note": "No tiene búsqueda ni lectura web en el modo headless que usa Pluma. La casilla de internet no le agrega flags. --dry-run impide escribir archivos y no se le pasa un flag de shell; --yes-always solo evita que se cuelgue pidiendo confirmación.",
      "args": [
        "--yes-always",
        "--no-auto-commits",
        "--no-dirty-commits",
        "--no-git",
        "--no-check-update",
        "--no-stream",
        "--no-pretty",
        "--dry-run",
        "--chat-history-file",
        "{run}/history.md",
        "--llm-history-file",
        "{run}/llm.txt"
      ],
      "promptVia": "file",
      "promptArg": "--message-file",
      "parser": "text",
      "stream": false,
      "images": "none",
      "modelArg": "--model",
      "rules": "prepend",
      "context": "prepend"
    }
  ]
}
